d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为林执中赋茂林十咏 其八 蕉台夜雨","author":"王恭","text":"云影蕉台秋气清，半檐凉雨夜深情。\n湘帘不卷犹残醉，遍向萧萧叶上声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为林执中赋茂林十咏 其九 松菊流芳","author":"王恭","text":"琴边霜菊袭人芳，鸟外寒松落幔凉。\n若道丘园心赏薄，渊明何事忆柴桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为林执中赋茂林十咏 其十 桑麻积翠","author":"王恭","text":"半亩桑麻绕舍青，雨馀晴翠入閒庭。\n春来多少生生意，分付林扉昼莫扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨竹","author":"王恭","text":"羞与宁王作管吹，肯随嬴女凤楼期。\n清平未奏云门乐，几见天寒坠叶时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书陈叔永高漫士所作小景扇头","author":"王恭","text":"鸟外群峰合翠微，半湖烟树隐楼扉。\n桐江未胜龙池好，聊向寒矶钓夕晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨梅","author":"王恭","text":"官路宫墙野水滨，空香何处更宜人。\n相思莫听桓伊管，吹落寒城五夜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴中美水墨扇头","author":"王恭","text":"垂萝书室隐清秋，千丈澄湖一叶舟。\n回首上林春物早，未应长被白云留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书陈抟大睡图","author":"王恭","text":"驴背谁教一笑还，白云高卧万机閒。\n大梁陵树秋声里，西华烟萝午梦间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题界画二图 其一","author":"王恭","text":"飞构凌空际楚天，远临衡霍见湘烟。\n阁中歌舞今谁在，芳草春波似昔年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题界画二图 其二","author":"王恭","text":"连甍复道露台秋，簪佩行随翠辇游。\n应是柏梁宫宴罢，侍臣词赋尽风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题施子安家藏萧翼赚得僧辨材兰亭卷","author":"王恭","text":"兰亭禊事迹空陈，片石犹传定武真。\n自是宸居贪玩物，不关萧翼解瞒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书高淮水墨扇","author":"王恭","text":"偶坐孤亭趋不稀，片云空翠湿罗衣。\n相逢莫话前朝事，剩水残山只雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书陆大守山水二图 其一","author":"王恭","text":"露下沧波叶尽流，千峰残雨一丝秋。\n孤帆谩忆桐江上，未胜滋泉下直钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书陆大守山水二图 其二","author":"王恭","text":"云际飞流见底清，惟应官暇爱山行。\n萝衣相对林中净，忘却春风五马荣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书鸲鹆小禽并枝图","author":"王恭","text":"娇养曾嗔解语迟，数声偏醉五陵儿。\n想应脱略樊笼去，甘与鹪鹩共一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衮尘骝","author":"王恭","text":"暂卸银鞍赐浴归，锦尘香扑衮龙飞。\n谁怜习战阴山北，满地黄埃苜蓿归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"王恭","text":"花落含章点翠蛾，曲随羌笛动情多。\n关心最是巢居阁，淡月凉云玛瑙坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题林峤扇","author":"王恭","text":"出谷閒行野杖随，水南村北夕阳时。\n山禽也解轻儒服，谁更中林独下帷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无酒","author":"王恭","text":"三径无资鬓已皤，一瓢閒却在烟萝。\n何时得遂弦歌兴，尽遣公田种术多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古寺 其一","author":"王恭","text":"白猿啼近雨花台，林下僧稀野殿开。\n借问萧梁何处在，空陵无树有荒苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古寺 其二","author":"王恭","text":"野寺僧残门半开，春风禅室见莓苔。\n数株松柏无枝叶，尽是唐人手自栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送老兵还乡 其一","author":"王恭","text":"曾逐嫖姚出汉关，故乡宁负老来还。\n到家莫恨无金印，数亩山田梦亦閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送老兵还乡 其二","author":"王恭","text":"百战沙场一剑知，龙钟双袖发垂丝。\n扁舟且逐还家兴，莫向燕然羡勒碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二马图","author":"王恭","text":"紫骝嘶逐玉花骢，曾是沙场百战功。\n今日宛驹无汗血，落花芳草灞陵东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽送校尉","author":"王恭","text":"驰逐三军出楚关，白头慈母望生还。\n归魂不到闽溪月，飞度临濠若个山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访羽人不值","author":"王恭","text":"仙坛花落正纷纷，洞入丹丘半白云。\n童子开门不相识，言师西去访茅君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏胡椒","author":"王恭","text":"结实重番小更繁，中原无地可移根。\n自从鼎鼐调和去，姜桂纷纷不共论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏倭扇","author":"王恭","text":"半剪青荷一片风，月华荡漾露珠融。\n谁知万里扶桑物，尽属中原掌握中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老渔","author":"王恭","text":"生事终年在水乡，龙钟双袖鬓如霜。\n于今不耐矶头坐，閒弄儿孙卧草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":35041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]